-- One-time data update: Amazon Water Run gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout (Moses, 15 Nov 2026: the World Tour re-layouts): until now
-- nearly the same track as Åre Run, Park City Run and the old World Tour
-- design. Over the first waterfall past the floating logs (the field now let go
-- in waves), tight S-bends through the jungle, the rapids, the caiman hairpin,
-- over the second waterfall (the big feature and signature, through its falling
-- water), the root spiral, S-bends along the river and the run to the village
-- on stilts. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its track record,
-- country records and players' personal bests start again from now
-- (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
